flowchart TD
StartNode["**Start MOO** 
Initializes NSGA-II optimization and links to the simulation model"]
BufferProblemNode["**BufferCapacityProblem** 
Attributes: n_var, n_obj, n_constr, xl, xu, n_replications, base_seed, n_cores
Methods: __init__, _evaluate"]
NsgaAlgorithmNode["**NSGA2Algorithm** 
Attributes: pop_size, sampling, crossover, mutation, eliminate_duplicates
Methods: __init__"]
EvalSingleNode["**EvaluateSingleIndividual** 
Inputs: x, n_replications, base_seed, warmup, measure_until
Outputs: wip, negative_throughput
Process: validates caps, seeds, runs simulation across replications, averages"]
RunSimulationNode["**RunSimulation** 
Inputs: seed, caps, warmup, measure_until
Outputs: results with throughput, wip, energy
Description: builds simpy environment and equipment and runs warmup and measurement"]
CheckTerminationNode["**Check termination** 
Not yet reached n_gen -> continue loop
Reached n_gen -> export results"]
ExportCsvNode["**ExportHistoryToCSV** 
Inputs: optimization history
Outputs: CSV file
Description: saves feasible solutions to results/moo_simulation_results.csv"]
EndNode["**End** 
Description: optimization finished and data exported"]

StartNode --> BufferProblemNode
BufferProblemNode --> NsgaAlgorithmNode
NsgaAlgorithmNode --> EvalSingleNode
EvalSingleNode --> RunSimulationNode
RunSimulationNode --> EvalSingleNode
EvalSingleNode --> NsgaAlgorithmNode
NsgaAlgorithmNode --> CheckTerminationNode
CheckTerminationNode -- No --> NsgaAlgorithmNode
CheckTerminationNode -- Yes --> ExportCsvNode
ExportCsvNode --> EndNode